SUMMARY:This or That!
DESCRIPTION:Join us for This or That! Every Thursday we’ll have different 
 activities ranging from open mic where you can express yourself freely and 
 share your passion for music\, poetry\, comedy\, storytelling or test your 
 knowledge during Trivia night challenge. We’ll have karaoke\, board 
 games\, and maybe something new. Each week you get the chance to vote on 
 what you would like to see next! \n\nDo you require an accommodation to 
 participate in a Phoenix Public Library program\, service\, or activity? 
 Call 602-262-4636\, TTY 711\, or submit your request in person or through 
 Ask Us at least 14 business days before the event
LOCATION:Teen Central\, Burton Barr Central Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Ryo Watson":MAILTO:ryo.watson@phoenix.gov
CATEGORIES:Teen Programs
